flow clauses
state {
  seen map[string]bool
}
var attempt int
source ingest Poll
transform a Step from ingest
  reads attempt  writes seen  over ratelimit.New(10)  idempotent  checkpoint machine.GobCodec[Order]{}
transform b Step from a
  checkpoint machine.GobCodec[Order]{}  over ratelimit.New(5)  writes seen  reads attempt
transform c Step from b
  note """clauses may be split across continuation lines"""
  on error Handle
sink done Store from c
  checkpoint machine.GobCodec[Order]{}  over pubsub.Topic("done")  idempotent
